  "passage": {
    "text": "Logistics is the work of moving goods from one place to another. Think about a pair of shoes. A factory makes them in Asia. A ship carries them across the sea. A truck takes them from the port to a warehouse. Then a driver delivers them to a shop in your city. Every step is part of the supply chain. A logistics company plans each step and keeps the goods safe. Good logistics means the customer gets the right product at the right time. Bad logistics means late deliveries and angry customers.",
